+
+    ``gpu_ids`` (the container's selectors from :func:`container_gpu_ids`, or a
+    comma-separated string) scopes the query to exactly those cards; ``None``
+    queries EVERY GPU on the host — the old rig-wide behaviour, which sums
+    other services' memory and must not be presented as the container's.
+    Returns ``{}`` when nvidia-smi is absent or fails.
